sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Browser
    participant MaintenanceController
    participant MaintenanceService
    participant ExpenseCategoryService
    participant FinancialService
    participant Db

    Admin->>Browser: Mark maintenance request as Completed
    Browser->>MaintenanceController: GET categories for condominium
    MaintenanceController->>ExpenseCategoryService: List active categories
    ExpenseCategoryService->>Db: SELECT active ExpenseCategories
    Db-->>ExpenseCategoryService: categories with hashtags
    ExpenseCategoryService-->>MaintenanceController: category DTOs
    MaintenanceController-->>Browser: category list

    Admin->>Browser: Check HasExpense, select category, enter amount
    Browser->>MaintenanceController: PATCH maintenance to Completed
    MaintenanceController->>MaintenanceService: Update status & expense details
    MaintenanceService->>MaintenanceService: Validate Admin role & condominium scope
    MaintenanceService->>MaintenanceService: If HasExpense then require ExpenseCategoryId
    MaintenanceService->>ExpenseCategoryService: Verify category belongs to condominium
    MaintenanceService->>FinancialService: Create/update expense FinancialRecord
    FinancialService->>Db: INSERT/UPDATE FinancialRecord with ExpenseCategoryId
    Db-->>FinancialService: persisted record
    FinancialService-->>MaintenanceService: financial record reference
    MaintenanceService->>Db: UPDATE MaintenanceRequest
    Db-->>MaintenanceService: persisted request
    MaintenanceService-->>MaintenanceController: result
    MaintenanceController-->>Browser: 200 OK
